&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW51270415 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW51270415 BCX8&quot;&gt;Provide technical input/insight during software design, development, testing, and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW51270415 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW51270415 BCX8&quot;&gt;release&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW51270415 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW51270415 BCX8&quot;&gt;Ensure support for fielded production deployments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;7+ years of experience leading and building technical teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience developing and/or leading teams developing software&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;applications with microservice architectures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated hands-on experience as a software engineer, with strong fundamentals in backend system design, distributed systems, and production-grade development. Experience with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Rust is strongly preferred&lt;/strong&gt;, along with the ability to learn, adopt, and advocate for modern systems-level languages and architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Leadership experience within agile cross-functional teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Apache Flink, RabbitMQ, or Hashicorp Vault&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable stepping in when needed for occasional development, triage, or troubleshooting support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in cybersecurity, OT, or ICS environments is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
